  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_2",
  "label": "User projected onto the scene of the 9/11 tragedy as the subject of the joke",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the entire scene of the 9/11 destruction (the 'tragedy_with_pun' scene) through the textual pun 'but their just, plane hilarious'. The joke implies that the user (or the viewer) is the one who finds the event 'plane hilarious', even though the text acknowledges the moral objection. The user is thus projected onto the scene as the one who is being asked to laugh, making them the target of the dark humor. The projection is onto the scene, which includes both the visual material and the textual material, but the core of the joke is the user's potential reaction.",
